00:34:06,753 --> 00:34:07,837
Ibu ada di sini!

397
00:34:08,671 --> 00:34:09,797
Ibu ada di sini!

398
00:34:10,631 --> 00:34:11,674
Ibu ada di sini!

399
00:34:28,608 --> 00:34:33,780
KOTA YANG INDAH, SUYEONG YANG BAHAGIA

400
00:34:33,863 --> 00:34:35,782
Mungkin dia pergi ke sana.

401
00:34:38,034 --> 00:34:39,077
Apa?

402
00:34:39,160 --> 00:34:42,914
Jika dia di sini, hanya tempat itu
yang akan dia datangi.

403
00:34:44,248 --> 00:34:45,083
Di mana itu?

404
00:35:12,527 --> 00:35:14,695
Geu-ru, ayo kita temui Ibu.

405
00:35:21,661 --> 00:35:23,412
Ibu tak di sini.

406
00:35:25,540 --> 00:35:26,541
Ibu ada di sini.

407
00:35:28,042 --> 00:35:28,918
Di mana?

408
00:35:36,217 --> 00:35:38,928
Di sini, dan di sini.

409
00:35:40,221 --> 00:35:42,682
Dan ada di sini juga.

410
00:35:50,022 --> 00:35:50,857
Geu-ru.

411
00:35:51,607 --> 00:35:53,192
Tutup matamu.

412
00:35:57,905 --> 00:36:00,908
Kau ingat bahwa kita sering kemari
bersama Ibu, 'kan?

413
00:36:01,826 --> 00:36:03,411
Aku bisa melihat Ibu.

414
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:07,373
Ibu, Geu-ru, dan Ayah.
Kita semua ada di sini.

415
00:37:48,808 --> 00:37:49,642
Tak boleh.

416
00:37:52,770 --> 00:37:54,105
Aku tak mau ini terjadi.

417
00:37:55,773 --> 00:37:56,816
Tolong keluar lagi.

418
00:37:58,359 --> 00:38:00,861
Ayolah. Cepat keluar.

419
00:38:02,154 --> 00:38:04,907
Keluarlah. Tak boleh seperti ini.

420
00:38:05,491 --> 00:38:07,827
Aku tak mau ini terjadi. Tak boleh.

421
00:38:07,910 --> 00:38:08,744
Geu-ru.

422
00:38:10,413 --> 00:38:12,456
- Tak boleh. Cepat keluarlah!
- Geu-ru!

423
00:38:12,540 --> 00:38:13,666
Geu-ru.

424
00:38:14,208 --> 00:38:15,126
